  "description": "In a night of loneliness and curiosity, Nabi accesses “LoveNet” and she nervously ends up having a date with the handsome and secretive Hasung, and falls in love with him. But once Nabi hears of an “ingenue” from Hasung's childhood friend Woojoon, she has her doubts. What should have been a trip for the Nabi and Hasung, she breaks it off after asking Hasun about this “ingenue”...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3358128), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/want_you), \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000054631)  \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51331557), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/everywy-se?hcb=1), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3358248), \n[Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H043400393), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H043400393), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/none?ind=2586), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000054632)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR15: [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0000446), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_0000257), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_1112)",
